---
config:
  layout: dagre
---
stateDiagram
  direction TB
  state IF_USER_CONFIRMATION <<choice>>
  [*] --> IF_USER_CONFIRMATION:🧑🏻‍💻<br>create Agreement Request
  IF_USER_CONFIRMATION --> PENDING_USER_CONFIRMATION:if Operator confirmation is required
  IF_USER_CONFIRMATION --> ACTION_NEEDED:if Operator confirmation is not required
  PENDING_USER_CONFIRMATION --> ACTION_NEEDED:🧑🏻‍💻<br>confirm on Producer Interop Node
  ACTION_NEEDED --> ACTION_NEEDED:🧑🏻‍💻 or 👷🏼 or 🌐<br>act
  ACTION_NEEDED --> Archived:🧑🏻‍💻 or 👷🏼 or 🌐<br>reject
  ACTION_NEEDED --> Active:👷🏼 or 🌐<br>activate
  Active --> Suspended:👷🏼 or 🧑🏻‍💻 or 🌐<br>suspend
  Suspended --> Active:👷🏼 or 🧑🏻‍💻 or 🌐<br>resume
  Active --> Archived:🧑🏻‍💻<br>archive
  Active --> Archived:🌐<br>auto-archive due to<br>Agreement upgrade <br>to new E-Service version
  Suspended --> Archived:🧑🏻‍💻<br>archive
  PENDING_USER_CONFIRMATION:Pending Operator confirmation
  ACTION_NEEDED:Submitted
  
  note left of ACTION_NEEDED 
  Required actions include e.g. automatic checks, explicit Producer approval, requests to the Consumer to complete additional steps.
  end note
  note right of Suspended 
  An Agreement can be suspended by any actor. It can only be resumed by the same actor.
  Multiple suspensions associated with different actors may exist at the same time.
  end note
  note left of root_start 
  🌐 = Producer Interop Node<br>
  👷🏼 = Producer Operator<br>
  🧑🏻‍💻 = Consumer Operator
  end note
